# Story tiers for ari.story (the audit's pacing model, Critical_Story_Audit_v1.0.md section 9.2).
#   spine    the main route: character development and the build-up to the ending, about 40 minutes of reading with every fight
#            won (tools/story_tiers.py counts every branch, so its total is higher). Romance is the player's choice at
#            ch3_decide; the rest of it is optional. Hubs (hub_*) offer each skipped stretch as an optional episode, and bridges
#            (bridge_*) carry the main route past it.
#   optional episodes: everything else, reached from a hub (or an existing optional choice) and kept whole.
#   arcade   (second column) also kept in a compressed arcade run
# Generated from the kept-scene list used to build the short route; scenes are named one by one.
# Format: <scene> <spine|optional> [arcade]

